    AmplifyShaderEditor, Version=0.0.0.0, Culture=neutral, PublicKeyToken=null;8;-432,-816;Inherit;False;686.7222;162.747;;;0,0,0,1;The
    Toggle Switch outputs one of its inputs according to the current toggle value
