    Version=0.0.0.0, Culture=neutral, PublicKeyToken=null;11;-432,-640;Inherit;False;687.012;109.7755;Generate
    Keyword;;0,0,0,1;By default Unity's material drawer used to show the toggle UI
    also internally generates a global shader keyword. Toggling this option off prevents
    this keyword from being generated.;0;0\nNode;AmplifyShaderEditor.StickyNoteNode,
    AmplifyShaderEditor, Version=0.0.0.0, Culture=neutral, PublicKeyToken=null;18;-528,-288;Inherit;False;318.7633;152.3624;Toggle;;0,0,0,1;Displays
    a float as a toggle. The property value will be 0 or 1, depending on the toggle
